{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/The_Director.png?t=1745858364\" /><strong>ATTENTION! This is the Director speaking.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome cadets and kittens to <strong>Insanitation</strong>. Here at CSP you will fight and <strong>strive to</strong> <strong>create Order or Chaos by any means necessary</strong>. No kibble too dry and no mop too wet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle in a head to head competition against up to 4 family members or friends where it's Cats VS Keepers. You decide the difficulty as you battle your way through houses and restaurants alike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>On your mark...get set... GO!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create <strong>Order</strong> As A <strong>Keeper</strong>  :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an agent of <strong>ORDER</strong> your task is to keep the area assigned to you as neat and tidy as it was built and designed ( if you can ).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/Keepers.png?t=1745858364\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create <strong>Chaos</strong> As A <strong>Cat</strong>  :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an agent of <strong>CHAOS</strong> your task is to keep the area assigned to you as disgustingly dirty as possible, wreaking havoc wherever your paws take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Clean Or Destroy 5\u00a0Crazy Chaotically Fun Maps</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map has been designed to offer a new challenge to face or create. Ranging from a <strong>Crazy Cat Lady's Apartment</strong>, a &quot;relaxed&quot; cozy <strong>Cat Cafe Restaurant</strong>, or an &quot;average&quot;\u00a0<strong>Home</strong> <strong>Insanitation</strong> has it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/Insanitation_House_Gif_3.gif?t=1745858364\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590370?t=1745858364","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590370?t=1745858364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/0958939894db94f262bb06cfa55393757c56a9fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745858364","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/0958939894db94f262bb06cfa55393757c56a9fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745858364","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/The_Director.png?t=1745858364\" /><strong>ATTENTION! This is the Director speaking.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome cadets and kittens to <strong>Insanitation</strong>. Here at CSP you will fight and <strong>strive to</strong> <strong>create Order or Chaos by any means necessary</strong>. No kibble too dry and no mop too wet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle in a head to head competition against up to 4 family members or friends where it's Cats VS Keepers. You decide the difficulty as you battle your way through houses and restaurants alike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>On your mark...get set... GO!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create <strong>Order</strong> As A <strong>Keeper</strong>  :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an agent of <strong>ORDER</strong> your task is to keep the area assigned to you as neat and tidy as it was built and designed ( if you can ).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/Keepers.png?t=1745858364\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create <strong>Chaos</strong> As A <strong>Cat</strong>  :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an agent of <strong>CHAOS</strong> your task is to keep the area assigned to you as disgustingly dirty as possible, wreaking havoc wherever your paws take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Clean Or Destroy 5\u00a0Crazy Chaotically Fun Maps</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map has been designed to offer a new challenge to face or create. Ranging from a <strong>Crazy Cat Lady's Apartment</strong>, a &quot;relaxed&quot; cozy <strong>Cat Cafe Restaurant</strong>, or an &quot;average&quot;\u00a0<strong>Home</strong> <strong>Insanitation</strong> has it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/Insanitation_House_Gif_3.gif?t=1745858364\" /></p>","developers":["If It Works Studio LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/4f91e4c01ff0687928369bbf24ebd6a41a4c6be9/header.jpg?t=1745858364","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Insanitation","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i